*adjusts glasses and studies the photograph with scholarly interest*

Fascinating... This appears to be documentation from Project Purity, a pre-plague biotechnology initiative. The subjects are Dr. Joric Thorne and Dr. Silas Kaine, lead researchers. Their work was... significant to our archives.

<|>{"give": [], "take": []}

*clasps hands solemnly*

The plague outbreak terminated their research. Dr. Thorne established the Oasis settlement afterward. Dr. Kaine... the records indicate nanite contamination led to his deteriorating mental state. A tragic loss of brilliant minds.

